# Brock 3rd floor tour (16px grid, world at 2x): spawn in the centre hall, loop the corridors, visit rooms.
wait 600ms
up 2.6s                 # centre hall -> north corridor
expect y < 320
left 7.32s              # along the north corridor to the west men's room door
down 3s               # into the men's room
expect y > 380
shot
up 3s
left 2s                 # to the west link
down 4.8s               # down the west link to the south corridor
expect y > 580
left 5.38s              # to the west study lounge door
up 4s                   # into the lounge
expect y < 560
shot
down 2s                 # back out to the middle of the south corridor
right 33s             # the whole south corridor
expect x > 2300
left 7.82s              # back to the east link
up 8s                   # up the east link and into room 330
expect y < 200
shot
expect no fell
